# Frontend layer (`/src/app`, `/src/features`, `/src/shared`)

## Scope

- Components, routing, layout, Tailwind, i18n, Zustand UI stores, hooks that **call** domain/data APIs.
- **Forbidden:** business rules (scoring, exam pass/fail, scheduling) in components — use `/src/domain`.

## Rules

- TypeScript strict; no `any`.
- **i18n:** every user-visible string is a key (`uk` default).
- **Mobile-first:** 360px baseline; tap targets ≥ 44px; no hover-only UX.
- **Accessibility:** semantic HTML, labels, focus management, keyboard support, WCAG AA contrast.
- **Data flow:** components → hooks/stores → repositories/domain; no direct Dexie in deep presentational components.
- Do not add UI component libraries without ADR/orchestrator approval.

## Testing

- React Testing Library; assert behavior and roles, not implementation details.

## Performance

- Lazy routes where sensible; avoid unnecessary Zustand subscriptions.
